================================================================================
Java dependencies
================================================================================

No third-party Java code is redistributed in this component's artifact.

Every dependency declared in runai-custom-providers/build.gradle is either
`compileOnly` — the Keycloak server provides it at runtime, and it is not
bundled into the built JAR — or `testImplementation` / `testRuntimeOnly`, which
is used only to run the test suite and is not distributed. The resulting JAR
contains NVIDIA-authored code exclusively.

For completeness, the compile-time-only dependencies are:

  - org.keycloak:keycloak-core, keycloak-server-spi, keycloak-services (26.6.+)
  - com.fasterxml.jackson.core:jackson-databind (2.+)
  - jakarta.ws.rs:jakarta.ws.rs-api (4.0.+)
  - org.slf4j:slf4j-api (2.0.+)

